  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>If you’re dreaming of building a global career in business, finance, marketing, or technology, DeMont Institute of Management and Technology (DIMT) can be a great choice for you. DIMT is a modern higher-education institute located in Dubai, UAE, offering globally recognised bachelor’s and master’s programmes.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At DIMT, life goes beyond the classroom. You’ll have many clubs, and cultural and social engagement activities to involve yourself in. Plus, you’ll also get access to placement and internship support, mental-wellbeing support, and career counselling sessions.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>DeMont Institute of Management and Technology in Dubai offers several student accommodation options, including the modern Myriad Ensuite and Yugo DubaiLand Ensuite residences, both located in Dubai International Academic City (DIAC). These options provide furnished en-suite rooms, Wi-Fi, and other amenities.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>If you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i>&nbsp;</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>DIMT’s library offers both a physical space for individual and collaborative work, as well as extensive online tools and resources. Plus, you can remotely access e-books, specialised databases, electronic journals, and films.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>AT DIMT, you’ll find a dedicated computer lab and a fashion lab, in addition to modern classrooms and auditoriums.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
